同字補姓名；先君太公與呂尚分開。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m025-0099","start":99,"end":102,"surface":"魯桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m025-0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m025-0118","start":118,"end":121,"surface":"齊襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"qj2_k5a_sq4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m025-0122","start":122,"end":124,"surface":"彭生","kind":"person","person_id":"wxj_wmw_39e","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p029","text":"初，襄公之醉殺魯桓公，通其夫人，殺誅數不當，淫於婦人，數欺大臣，群弟恐禍及，故次弟糾奔魯。其母魯女也。管仲、召忽傅之。次弟小白奔莒，鮑叔傅之。小白母，衛女也，有寵於釐公。小白自少好善大夫高傒。及雍林人殺無知，議立君，高、國先陰召小白於莒。魯聞無知死，亦發兵送公子糾，而使管仲別將兵遮莒道，射中小白帶鉤。小白詳死，管仲使人馳報魯。魯送糾者行益遲，六日至齊，則小白已入，高傒立之，是為桓公。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"qj2_k5a_sq4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"魯桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"其夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"z16_hit_u7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"群弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、族稱或未定指代，不補未見姓名與成員；官禮等級不直接當授官。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"糾","kind":"person","person_id":"fng_mjp_tdn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"魯女","kind":"person","person_id":"i7a_rc8_hf1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m029-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"管仲","kin